WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.802
Benjamin Bunny sat by the road.

2
00:00:07.803 --> 00:00:11.337
Clop, clop! Clop, clop!

3
00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:15.338
A horse walked along the road.

4
00:00:15.339 --> 00:00:23.956
The horse was pulling a wagon.

5
00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:29.975
"It's the farmer and his wife," thought Benjamin.

6
00:00:29.976 --> 00:00:33.069
"They are going to town."

7
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.688
Benjamin smiled.

8
00:00:35.689 --> 00:00:43.977
"I'll find my cousin Peter!"

9
00:00:43.978 --> 00:00:51.145
Benjamin ran to Peter's tree.

10
00:00:51.146 --> 00:00:55.206
He peeked inside.

11
00:00:55.207 --> 00:00:58.538
Mrs. Rabbit was knitting.

12
00:00:58.539 --> 00:01:04.470
"I don't want to see her," thought Benjamin.

13
00:01:04.471 --> 00:01:10.890
He saw Flopsy, Mopsy, and Cotton-tail.

14
00:01:10.891 --> 00:01:17.393
"Where's Peter?" thought Benjamin.

15
00:01:17.394 --> 00:01:25.497
He went to the other side of the tree.

16
00:01:25.498 --> 00:01:31.444
He crawled down a hole.

17
00:01:31.445 --> 00:01:34.337
And there was Peter.

18
00:01:34.338 --> 00:01:38.410
He was wearing a red handkerchief.

19
00:01:38.411 --> 00:01:42.099
He looked sad.

20
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.799
"Peter!" said Benjamin.

21
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:49.622
"What happened to you?

22
00:01:49.623 --> 00:01:52.757
Where are your clothes?"

23
00:01:52.758 --> 00:01:57.717
Peter sniffed.

24
00:01:57.718 --> 00:02:01.560
"I lost them in the farmer's garden.

25
00:02:01.561 --> 00:02:04.568
I went there yesterday.

26
00:02:04.569 --> 00:02:11.515
The farmer chased me."

27
00:02:11.516 --> 00:02:15.928
"I have good news," said Benjamin.

28
00:02:15.929 --> 00:02:19.389
"The farmer and his wife went to town.

29
00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:25.193
We can look for your clothes!"

